        "DetailBusinessProduct": {
          "description": "Extends BusinessProduct. Used in getProductDetail response. Adds selectedAttributes[] and overrides attributes.choices with DetailAttributeChoice (carries inStock + inCatalog availability signals). UCP equivalent: DetailProduct.\n",
